<newsitem itemid="126293" id="root" date="1996-10-18" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bolwear half year share, div falls.</title>
<headline>Bolwear half year share, div falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     9.3	   vs 11.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 2.5	   vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.86	  vs 2.29</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.96	  vs 3.82</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.10	  vs 1.54</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.40	  vs 0.99</p>
<p>    Turnover		  122.33	vs 125.99</p>
<p>Full name: Bolton Footwear Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said a poor business climate of accelerating imports and declining production was unlikely to improve resulting in profits for the year being much lower than those in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
